Error [jet.ImplOnBuiltinType]: `impl Int.Printable` needs a user-defined type
  --> tests/ui/impl_foreign_trait_on_builtin_type.jet:3:6
    |
  3 | impl Int.Printable {
    |      ^^^
 Why: `Int` is built in, and an `impl` only extends a struct, enum, or distinct type declared by your program
 Fix: Implement `Printable` on a struct or distinct type of your own, or wrap `Int` in one
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0301
